                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="stats-box">
                    <h4>Volatility Adjustment</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>In high-vol regimes, reduce position size by ~{(1 - annualized_vol/(high_vol_threshold))/2*100:.0f}%</li>
                        <li>Crisis periods may warrant {(crisis_threshold/annualized_vol - 1)*100:.0f}% vol increase</li>
                    </ul>
